        {"zh": "我把长喙插进土里，歇一会儿。", "en": "I push my long beak into the soil and rest a while."},
        {"zh": "咕咕咕，寻找种子！", "en": "Gogogoo, seeking seeds!"},
        {"zh": "森林是我的乐园！", "en": "Forest is my paradise!"},
        {"zh": "咕咕咕，我的地盘！", "en": "Gogogoo, my turf!"},
