        {"zh": "咕咕咕，你好漂亮！", "en": "Gogogoo, you’re so pretty!"},
        {"zh": "你身后那只猫，也跟你一起来的？", "en": "That cat behind you — did it come with you?"},
        {"zh": "咕咕咕，你真聪明！", "en": "Gogogoo, so smart!"},
        {"zh": "咕咕咕，跟我走！", "en": "Gogogoo, follow me!"},
